    "description": "Miqui shares an apartment with his best friend, Èric, and leads a more or less stable life until, in the span of just a few days, two unexpected events force him to rethink his entire future. Left with few alternatives, he ends up moving back into the family home, where he must live with his parents again while trying to rebuild his personal and professional life. Surrounding him are neighbors, friends, and family members who turn every minor daily issue into an endless source of complications, misunderstandings, and situations that are absurdly relatable.",
